      "created_at": "2015-05-13T12:47:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yep! &nbsp;Not sure I'll bring SotM since I don't have anything sleeved, but my camp does typically bring a few non-period games. &nbsp;I suspect there will be Concept (since it can handle a large number of people), maybe Evolution (which IS sleeved and has been enjoyed by friends in other camps), probably Citadels since that went over well last year, probably Icehouse pyramids (three of us in camp have sets of those, actually), and maybe one or two others. &nbsp;I might have to pick up Camel [C]up, come to think of it...</p><p>Will you be hitting PennLite this weekend, out of curiosity?</p>",
